# Codex-only skills installed via `npx skills add -a codex`.
#
# Format: <package>
#   - <package> is a github repo (owner/name) or URL handed to `skills add`
#
# These skills are installed for Codex via `skills add -a codex`. For
# Claude Code, prefer claude-plugins.list — the native plugin manager
# pulls commands/agents/hooks/MCP servers in addition to skills.
#
# Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored.

